| RISC3D test kit 38: contexts that share objects, drawing in two
| threads at once (sharetest), as WebKit's Skia will. Writes
| ShareResults in this folder.
RMEnsure RISC3D 0.06 Error Copy this kit's !RISC3D into !Boot.Resources and restart first (see !ReadMe)
Echo RISC3D shared contexts { > <Obey$Dir>.ShareResults }
Run <Obey$Dir>.sharetest { >> <Obey$Dir>.ShareResults }
RISC3D { >> <Obey$Dir>.ShareResults }
Unset Share$NoLinux
RMEnsure Linux3D 0.00 Set Share$NoLinux 1
If "<Share$NoLinux>"="" Then Linux3D { >> <Obey$Dir>.ShareResults }
Unset Share$NoLinux
SetType <Obey$Dir>.ShareResults Text
Filer_Run <Obey$Dir>.ShareResults
